== Teacher Notes

- In 9 and 10, treat polyatomic ions such as $"SO"_4$, $"OH"$ and $"PO"_4$ as single units when they appear unchanged on both sides.
- In 8, balance carbon first, then hydrogen, and oxygen last.
- Check every answer by counting atoms of each element on both sides. For example, in question 6 there are 4 Fe and 6 O on each side.